{"summary":"尿坑泥是沉积于厕所坑中的泥土，具有解毒作用，主要用于治疗蜂、蝎等毒虫叮咬，外涂即可。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）","translation":"（出自《本草纲目》）"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"主蜂蝎诸虫咬，取涂之（时珍）。","translation":"主治蜂、蝎等各种毒虫叮咬，取尿坑泥涂抹患处（李时珍）。"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E5%9C%9F%E9%83%A8#尿坑泥","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:20.994Z"}